arguments.message:
✅ **COS 挂载技能已创建！**

📂 位置：`~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/cos-mount/`

---

**使用前需配置环境变量：**

在 `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json` 中添加：

```json
{
  "skills": {
    "entries": {
      "cos-mount": {
        "enabled": true,
        "env": {
          "COS_SECRET_ID": "你的SecretId",
          "COS_SECRET_KEY": "你的SecretKey",
          "COS_BUCKET": "存储桶名称",
          "COS_REGION": "ap-guangzhou",
          "COS_MOUNT_POINT": "/mnt/cos"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

**命令：**
```bash
# 挂载
python3 ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/cos-mount/cos_mount.py mount

# 卸载
python3 ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/cos-mount/cos_mount.py umount

# 状态
python3 ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/cos-mount/cos_mount.py status
```

